    {
      "id": 2,
      "date": "2026-01-19T21:33:47",
      "modified": "2026-01-19T21:33:47",
      "slug": "sample-page",
      "status": "publish",
      "link": "https://www.iowabowlingcoaches.org/sample-page/",
      "title": "Sample Page",
      "excerpt": "<p>This is an example page. It&#8217;s different from a blog post because it will stay in one place and will show up in your site navigation (in most themes). Most people start with an About page that introduces them to potential site visitors. It might say something like this: Hi there! I&#8217;m a bike messenger [&hellip;]</p>\n",
      "content": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">This is an example page. It&#8217;s different from a blog post because it will stay in one place and will show up in your site navigation (in most themes). Most people start with an About page that introduces them to potential site visitors. It might say something like this:</p>\n\n\n\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow\">\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Hi there! I&#8217;m a bike messenger by day, aspiring actor by night, and this is my website. I live in Los Angeles, have a great dog named Jack, and I like pi&#241;a coladas. (And gettin&#8217; caught in the rain.)</p>\n\n</blockquote>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">&#8230;or something like this:</p>\n\n\n\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow\">\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The XYZ Doohickey Company was founded in 1971, and has been providing quality doohickeys to the public ever since. Located in Gotham City, XYZ employs over 2,000 people and does all kinds of awesome things for the Gotham community.</p>\n\n</blockquote>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">As a new WordPress user, you should go to <a href=\"https://www.iowabowlingcoaches.org/wp-admin/\">your dashboard</a> to delete this page and create new pages for your content. Have fun!</p>\n",
      "featuredMedia": 0
    }
  ],
  "posts": [
    {
      "id": 97,
      "date": "2026-02-23T19:04:22",
      "modified": "2026-02-23T19:04:22",
      "slug": "boys-end-of-season-awards",
      "status": "publish",
      "link": "https://www.iowabowlingcoaches.org/2026/02/23/boys-end-of-season-awards/",
      "title": "Boys end of season awards",
      "excerpt": "<p>Hello coaches! The Boys (and Girls) All-District and All-State selections are active on the website, which you can find HERE. You can also request your certificates HERE. Please check your athletes&#8217; names over for spelling and if you feel there is something incorrect, reach out to me directly so we can take a look. I [&hellip;]</p>\n",
      "content": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Hello coaches!</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The Boys (and Girls) All-District and All-State selections are active on the website, which you can find <a href=\"https://www.iowabowlingcoaches.org/33-2/\" data-type=\"page\" data-id=\"33\">HERE</a>. You can also request your certificates <a href=\"https://iowabowlingcoaches.us3.list-manage.com/track/click?u=6120e329c6f3866aa72a09202&amp;id=f0cc26c3c3&amp;e=beb7af69a8\">HERE</a>.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Please check your athletes&#8217; names over for spelling and if you feel there is something incorrect, reach out to me directly so we can take a look. I appreciate a couple of you helping me notice a needed change when we released the girls. Thank you all, and best of luck with your Boys&#8217; SQM&#8217;s tomorrow!!</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Respectfully,<br>Brandon Steen</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n",
      "featuredMedia": 0
    },
    {
      "id": 77,
      "date": "2026-02-07T19:45:10",
      "modified": "2026-04-03T18:06:59",
      "slug": "end-of-season-awards",
      "status": "publish",
      "link": "https://www.iowabowlingcoaches.org/2026/02/07/end-of-season-awards/",
      "title": "End of Season Awards",
      "excerpt": "<p>Hey everyone! Thank you all for letting me know when your makeup meets were done. I really appreciate the communication. The Girls All-District and All-State selections are on the website, which you can find HERE. You can also request your certificates HERE. Please check your athletes&#8217; names over for spelling and if you feel there [&hellip;]</p>\n",
      "content": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><br><br>Hey everyone!</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Thank you all for letting me know when your makeup meets were done. I really appreciate the communication. The Girls All-District and All-State selections are on the website, which you can find <a href=\"https://www.iowabowlingcoaches.org/33-2/\" data-type=\"page\" data-id=\"33\">HERE</a>. You can also request your certificates <a href=\"https://iowabowlingcoaches.us3.list-manage.com/track/click?u=6120e329c6f3866aa72a09202&amp;id=f0cc26c3c3&amp;e=beb7af69a8\">HERE</a>.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Please check your athletes&#8217; names over for spelling and if you feel there is something incorrect, reach out to me directly so we can take a look. Thank you all, and best of luck to those competing in Waterloo this coming week!</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">PS &#8211; Big thank you to Matt Schneider for getting these on the website promptly!!</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Respectfully,<br>Brandon Steen</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Brandon Steen</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n",
      "featuredMedia": 0
    },
    {
      "id": 43,
      "date": "2026-01-20T21:02:30",
      "modified": "2026-01-20T21:02:30",
      "slug": "new-site",
      "status": "publish",
      "link": "https://www.iowabowlingcoaches.org/2026/01/20/new-site/",
      "title": "New Site",
      "excerpt": "<p>Sorry to anyone that was trying to get here during the season. A few updates were required that I now have in place. Awards from previous seasons are now available and I will get additional items added as they are needed. This season&#8217;s awards will be out in February, until then&#8230; Good Luck!!</p>\n",
      "content": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Sorry to anyone that was trying to get here during the season.  A few updates were required that I now have in place.  Awards from previous seasons are now available and I will get additional items added as they are needed.  This season&#8217;s awards will be out in February, until then&#8230;   Good Luck!!</p>\n",
      "featuredMedia": 0
    }
  ],
